            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "神秘能源是什么\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumicenergistics:tut_addon_thaumicenergistics/text/2",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumicenergistics.tut_addon_thaumicenergistics.text.2",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "神秘能源让"
                },
                {
                  "text": "应用能源 2",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "（AE2）可以储存和运输源质：源质存储元件、输入/输出总线、源质终端，还能在 ME 网络中进行奥术合成和注魔自动化。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumicenergistics:tut_addon_thaumicenergistics/divider/3",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumicenergistics:tut_addon_thaumicenergistics/text/4",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumicenergistics.tut_addon_thaumicenergistics.text.4",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "从哪里开始\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumicenergistics:tut_addon_thaumicenergistics/text/5",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumicenergistics.tut_addon_thaumicenergistics.text.5",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicenergistics:START"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：神秘能源，自动解锁。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicenergistics:CORES"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：扩散核心，需要"
                },
                {
                  "research": "DISTILESSENTIA"
                },
                {
                  "text": "。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicenergistics:STORAGE"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：1k 源质存储元件。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicenergistics:IO"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：源质网络输入/输出。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicenergistics:ARCANE_TERMINAL"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：奥术合成终端。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicenergistics:INFUSION_PROVIDER"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：注魔供应器，让 ME 网络为注魔祭坛供料。\n你需要先对 AE2 有基本了解。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
